{"id": "20536728", "revid": "20957809", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20536728", "title": "Christ Church (Owensville, Maryland)", "text": "Christ Church, or Christ Episcopal Church, West River, is an historic Carpenter Gothic style Episcopal church at Owensville, Anne Arundel County, Maryland, United States. It is a small, board-and-batten church with a long narrow nave, small deep chancel, and an entrance porch on its south side. The church is reputed to be by the noted church architect, Richard Upjohn and was at least built from his published designs of 1852.\nChrist Church was listed on the National Register of Historic Places in 1973."}
