{"id": "20540950", "revid": "45817322", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20540950", "title": "Hemanter Pakhi", "text": "Hemanter Pakhi (; Autumn Bird) is an Indian Bengali feature film directed by Urmi Chakraborty.\nPlot.\nA Bengali housewife takes up a writing career after 23 years of marriage. She is introduced to a new world and new friends. Her work gets appreciated, and this in turn brings a new twist in her life. She starts discovering her husband and her beloved children in a new light. This creates trouble in her family, and she sacrifices her dream for the sake of her family."}
